            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚂 <strong>TrainClicker Idle Evolution – Relax. Upgrade. Collect!</strong> 🚂</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a <strong>cozy and relaxing adventure</strong> to chill out with? Welcome aboard <strong>TrainClicker Idle Evolution</strong>, where you’ll build, upgrade, and customize your very own train as it travels through <strong>beautiful handcrafted landscapes</strong>. Relax with idle progress or <strong>test your management skills in this epic journey. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your play style: <strong>kick back and chill</strong> or <strong>strategize and rise to the top!</strong> The journey is yours to shape, and with the right upgrades, you’ll evolve your train from a humble handcar to a <strong>mighty long locomotive.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛤️ <strong>What Makes This Ride Awesome:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ <strong>Relax and Play Your Way</strong> – Whether you want a casual chill vibe or a challenge, we've got you!<br>✅ <strong>Beautifully Crafted Zones</strong> – Travel through stunning, cozy environments with unique themes.<br>✅ <strong>Engineer Heroes</strong> – Unlock and upgrade heroes with special abilities to automate progress and keep things rolling!<br>✅ <strong>Endless Customization &amp; Upgrades</strong> – From handcars to steam, diesel, and beyond—build YOUR ultimate train!<br>✅ <strong>Optimized Progression for Maximum Fun</strong> – Experience that sweet, satisfying feeling when every upgrade just clicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hop aboard and start your journey today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚂 <strong>We’re waiting for you at the next station!</strong> 🚂</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚂 <strong>TrainClicker Idle Evolution – Relax. Upgrade. Collect!</strong> 🚂</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a <strong>cozy and relaxing adventure</strong> to chill out with? Welcome aboard <strong>TrainClicker Idle Evolution</strong>, where you’ll build, upgrade, and customize your very own train as it travels through <strong>beautiful handcrafted landscapes</strong>. Relax with idle progress or <strong>test your management skills in this epic journey. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your play style: <strong>kick back and chill</strong> or <strong>strategize and rise to the top!</strong> The journey is yours to shape, and with the right upgrades, you’ll evolve your train from a humble handcar to a <strong>mighty long locomotive.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛤️ <strong>What Makes This Ride Awesome:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ <strong>Relax and Play Your Way</strong> – Whether you want a casual chill vibe or a challenge, we've got you!<br>✅ <strong>Beautifully Crafted Zones</strong> – Travel through stunning, cozy environments with unique themes.<br>✅ <strong>Engineer Heroes</strong> – Unlock and upgrade heroes with special abilities to automate progress and keep things rolling!<br>✅ <strong>Endless Customization &amp; Upgrades</strong> – From handcars to steam, diesel, and beyond—build YOUR ultimate train!<br>✅ <strong>Optimized Progression for Maximum Fun</strong> – Experience that sweet, satisfying feeling when every upgrade just clicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hop aboard and start your journey today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚂 <strong>We’re waiting for you at the next station!</strong> 🚂</p>",
            "short_description": "🚂 Cozy idle train game. Enjoy a journey from steam to modern locomotives in idle style! 🚂",
